# Modules with no behaviour to test, so no co-located overlay is required.
# One path per line, relative to the repository root.
#
# These two are generated by tools/gentables.j and tools/genenzymes.j and hold
# nothing but lookup tables. They are listed here rather than marked in their
# own headers because the generators rewrite those headers on every run.
# tools/check-extra.sh proves the committed data still matches its generator,
# which is the check that actually matters for them.
src/topics/tabledata.j
src/topics/enzymedata.j
